DESCRIPTION:Our Center for Veteran & Military Students (CVMS) here on the 
 IU Bloomington campus processes GI Bill® benefits and supports military-c
 onnected students by providing information and connecting students to the
  right resources.\nLocation: Center for Veteran and Military Students: 82
 3 E. 11th Street\, Bloomington\, Indiana 47408. ADA ENTRANCE LOCATED ON T
 HE NORTH SIDE PARKING AREA.\nIf you are not an IU student or employee\, y
 ou can park in the Indiana Memorial Union pay parking lot (corner of 7th 
 St. and Woodlawn Google address is 910 E. 8th St.) and we will have passe
 s available for you at the center. Please make a note that you will need 
 a pass if you RSVP. \nAll Indiana University events\, groups\, activities
 \, and educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all IU
  students and other members of the Indiana University community.\n\nHoste
 d by: Center for Veteran and Military Students\n\nAdditional Information 
 can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12472261
